{"content_hash": "ed75347d28388149", "version_id": 915, "article_id": 92, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "MOUZ sweep to IEM Beijing 2026 title unbeaten", "title_zh": "MOUZ 全胜横扫，拿下 IEM 北京 2026 冠军", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/024/041.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589100957915-44c9c9228464?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8bW91eiUyMGllbSUyMG1ham9yfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQxODYzNDR8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by wu yi on Unsplash", "author": "wu yi", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@takeshi2?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-and-white-bluetooth-earphones-vsCK6oPj5KY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(92, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(130, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "767cdf81a8f4"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-09", "word_count": 273, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "MOUZ claimed the IEM Beijing 2026 Counter-Strike 2 crown without dropping a single match, brushing aside The MongolZ 3-0 in the final. Attention now shifts to BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong, the last serious warm-up before the Singapore Major.", "lead_zh": "MOUZ 在 IEM 北京 2026《反恐精英2》赛事中一路全胜夺冠，决赛 3:0 轻取 The MongolZ。接下来，各队的目光转向 BLAST Premier Rivals 香港站——新加坡 Major 之前最后一场重要的热身赛。", "preview": "The IEM Beijing 2026 Counter-Strike 2 tournament concluded yesterday, with MOUZ lifting the trophy after a commanding 3-0 victory over The M", "preview_zh": "IEM 北京 2026《反恐精英2》赛事于昨日落幕，MOUZ 在总决赛中以 3:0 完胜 The MongolZ，捧起冠军奖杯。这支欧洲战队全程未尝一败，以极具说服力的方式击败了赛前被普遍看好能给他们制造麻烦的对手，进一步坐实了其作为巡回赛上最稳定队伍之一的地位。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 898, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 111.7, "size_bytes": 671184, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 308, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 113.375, "size_bytes": 681264, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 308, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 118.675, "size_bytes": 712944, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 308, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 104.0, "size_bytes": 624960, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 308, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/92/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 114.625, "size_bytes": 688752, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 308, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/92/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@aa52671/content/data/versions/915.json", "paragraphs": ["The IEM Beijing 2026 Counter-Strike 2 tournament concluded yesterday, with MOUZ lifting the trophy after a commanding 3-0 victory over The MongolZ in the grand final. Having gone the entire event without a single defeat, the European side underlined its credentials as one of the most consistent outfits on the circuit, and did so in emphatic fashion against an opponent widely tipped to trouble them.", "In the third-place decider, NAVI proved equally ruthless, dispatching BB 2-0 to round off the podium. The result offered the Ukrainian organisation a measure of consolation after a campaign that fell short of the title, while BB were left to reflect on a run that nonetheless exceeded many expectations heading into the event.", "For Chinese fans, however, the headline result was less encouraging: TYLOO finished in the 9th-to-12th bracket, a placing that leaves the home side with plenty to address before the sport's biggest stage. That the country's flagship roster exited well before the closing stages will inevitably sharpen scrutiny of its preparations.", "No sooner had the Beijing curtain fallen than attention turned to BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026, scheduled for the 11th to the 15th of this month. Widely regarded as the final meaningful rehearsal ahead of the PGL Major Singapore 2026, the Hong Kong event affords teams a last chance to fine-tune line-ups and map pools under competitive pressure.", "With the Major looming, the coming week carries considerable weight. Performances in Hong Kong are unlikely to alter established hierarchies overnight, yet they may prove instructive for sides still searching for form, and potentially decisive for those whose seeding or confidence hinges on a strong showing."], "paragraphs_zh": ["IEM 北京 2026《反恐精英2》赛事于昨日落幕，MOUZ 在总决赛中以 3:0 完胜 The MongolZ，捧起冠军奖杯。这支欧洲战队全程未尝一败，以极具说服力的方式击败了赛前被普遍看好能给他们制造麻烦的对手，进一步坐实了其作为巡回赛上最稳定队伍之一的地位。", "季军争夺战中，NAVI 同样毫不手软，以 2:0 横扫 BB，锁定领奖台最后一席。这一结果对这支乌克兰俱乐部多少算是安慰——本届赛事他们终究与冠军无缘；而 BB 虽败，其表现仍超出不少人赛前的预期。", "不过对中国观众而言，最受关注的结果并不乐观：TYLOO 止步 9 至 12 名，这样的名次意味着这支本土战队在通往最高舞台之前还有不少问题需要解决。中国头号阵容早早出局，势必会让外界对其备战情况更加挑剔。", "北京站的帷幕刚刚落下，人们的目光便转向本月 11 日至 15 日举行的 BLAST Premier Rivals 香港 2026。这项赛事被普遍视为 PGL Major 新加坡 2026 之前最后一场有分量的练兵，各队得以在实战压力下最后打磨阵容与地图池。", "随着 Major 临近，未来一周的分量不容小觑。香港站的表现未必能一夜之间改写既有格局，但对仍在寻找状态的队伍而言颇具参考价值，对那些排名种子或士气系于一役的战队来说，甚至可能至关重要。"], "body": "The IEM Beijing 2026 Counter-Strike 2 tournament concluded yesterday, with MOUZ lifting the trophy after a commanding 3-0 victory over The MongolZ in the grand final. Having gone the entire event without a single defeat, the European side underlined its credentials as one of the most consistent outfits on the circuit, and did so in emphatic fashion against an opponent widely tipped to trouble them.\n\nIn the third-place decider, NAVI proved equally ruthless, dispatching BB 2-0 to round off the podium. The result offered the Ukrainian organisation a measure of consolation after a campaign that fell short of the title, while BB were left to reflect on a run that nonetheless exceeded many expectations heading into the event.\n\nFor Chinese fans, however, the headline result was less encouraging: TYLOO finished in the 9th-to-12th bracket, a placing that leaves the home side with plenty to address before the sport's biggest stage. That the country's flagship roster exited well before the closing stages will inevitably sharpen scrutiny of its preparations.\n\nNo sooner had the Beijing curtain fallen than attention turned to BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026, scheduled for the 11th to the 15th of this month. Widely regarded as the final meaningful rehearsal ahead of the PGL Major Singapore 2026, the Hong Kong event affords teams a last chance to fine-tune line-ups and map pools under competitive pressure.\n\nWith the Major looming, the coming week carries considerable weight. Performances in Hong Kong are unlikely to alter established hierarchies overnight, yet they may prove instructive for sides still searching for form, and potentially decisive for those whose seeding or confidence hinges on a strong showing.", "body_zh": "IEM 北京 2026《反恐精英2》赛事于昨日落幕，MOUZ 在总决赛中以 3:0 完胜 The MongolZ，捧起冠军奖杯。这支欧洲战队全程未尝一败，以极具说服力的方式击败了赛前被普遍看好能给他们制造麻烦的对手，进一步坐实了其作为巡回赛上最稳定队伍之一的地位。\n\n季军争夺战中，NAVI 同样毫不手软，以 2:0 横扫 BB，锁定领奖台最后一席。这一结果对这支乌克兰俱乐部多少算是安慰——本届赛事他们终究与冠军无缘；而 BB 虽败，其表现仍超出不少人赛前的预期。\n\n不过对中国观众而言，最受关注的结果并不乐观：TYLOO 止步 9 至 12 名，这样的名次意味着这支本土战队在通往最高舞台之前还有不少问题需要解决。中国头号阵容早早出局，势必会让外界对其备战情况更加挑剔。\n\n北京站的帷幕刚刚落下，人们的目光便转向本月 11 日至 15 日举行的 BLAST Premier Rivals 香港 2026。这项赛事被普遍视为 PGL Major 新加坡 2026 之前最后一场有分量的练兵，各队得以在实战压力下最后打磨阵容与地图池。\n\n随着 Major 临近，未来一周的分量不容小觑。香港站的表现未必能一夜之间改写既有格局，但对仍在寻找状态的队伍而言颇具参考价值，对那些排名种子或士气系于一役的战队来说，甚至可能至关重要。", "text": "The IEM Beijing 2026 Counter-Strike 2 tournament concluded yesterday, with MOUZ lifting the trophy after a commanding 3-0 victory over The MongolZ in the grand final. Having gone the entire event without a single defeat, the European side underlined its credentials as one of the most consistent outfits on the circuit, and did so in emphatic fashion against an opponent widely tipped to trouble them. In the third-place decider, NAVI proved equally ruthless, dispatching BB 2-0 to round off the podium. The result offered the Ukrainian organisation a measure of consolation after a campaign that fell short of the title, while BB were left to reflect on a run that nonetheless exceeded many expectations heading into the event. For Chinese fans, however, the headline result was less encouraging: TYLOO finished in the 9th-to-12th bracket, a placing that leaves the home side with plenty to address before the sport's biggest stage. That the country's flagship roster exited well before the closing stages will inevitably sharpen scrutiny of its preparations. No sooner had the Beijing curtain fallen than attention turned to BLAST Premier Rivals Hong Kong 2026, scheduled for the 11th to the 15th of this month. Widely regarded as the final meaningful rehearsal ahead of the PGL Major Singapore 2026, the Hong Kong event affords teams a last chance to fine-tune line-ups and map pools under competitive pressure. With the Major looming, the coming week carries considerable weight. Performances in Hong Kong are unlikely to alter established hierarchies overnight, yet they may prove instructive for sides still searching for form, and potentially decisive for those whose seeding or confidence hinges on a strong showing.", "vocab": [{"word": "commanding", "pos": "adj", "zh": "压倒性的，占据绝对优势的", "note": "常修饰 victory、lead、performance，形容优势明显", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dispatch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "击败，了结（对手）", "note": "体育报道中比 beat 更书面，常见 dispatch sb 2-0", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ruthless", "pos": "adj", "zh": "毫不留情的，冷酷高效的", "note": "形容比赛风格果断、不给对手机会", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "decider", "pos": "noun", "zh": "决胜局；决定名次的比赛", "note": "third-place decider 即季军赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "consolation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "安慰，慰藉", "note": "a measure of consolation 表示“些许安慰”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fall short of", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "未能达到，不及", "note": "fall short of the title 即与冠军失之交臂", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bracket", "pos": "noun", "zh": "（名次）区间，档位", "note": "9th-to-12th bracket 指第 9 至 12 名的排位区间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "flagship", "pos": "adj", "zh": "旗舰级的，头号的", "note": "flagship roster 指一支队伍中的头号阵容", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sharpen scrutiny", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "加剧审视，引来更严格的关注", "note": "新闻常用搭配，scrutiny 常与 sharpen、intensify 连用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rehearsal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "演练，预演", "note": "final meaningful rehearsal 指“最后一场有分量的练兵”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fine-tune", "pos": "verb", "zh": "微调，精细打磨", "note": "常接 line-ups、tactics 等", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "loom", "pos": "verb", "zh": "逼近，迫在眉睫", "note": "The Major looming 表示大赛将至", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hierarchy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "等级格局，层级秩序", "note": "alter established hierarchies 指改变既有强弱格局", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hinge on", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "取决于，系于", "note": "hinge on a strong showing 即成败系于一次出色表现", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-09T01:05:42.896149", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.388, "sm": 250, "em": 387, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "IEM", "s": 0.388, "e": 1.163, "sm": 387, "em": 1162, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Beijing", "s": 1.163, "e": 1.65, "sm": 1162, "em":